{"id": "dev-say-0016", "system": "kotoba-whisper-bilingual-v1.0-q8.greedy", "stage": "asr", "hyp": "バッキサイズを32にいや16に下げたらブイラムに収まりました", "latency_s": 0.7074608750408515, "details": {"logmel_s": 0.0024157920852303505, "encoder_s": 0.6534156670095399, "decoder_s": 0.05159687495324761, "n_tokens": 25.0}}
{"id": "dev-say-0017", "system": "kotoba-whisper-bilingual-v1.0-q8.greedy", "stage": "asr", "hyp": "GITHUBACTIOSのワークフローで、TETESTが失敗しているのでログを確認してもらえますか。", "latency_s": 0.7310244999825954, "details": {"logmel_s": 0.0023419170174747705, "encoder_s": 0.6586230000248179, "decoder_s": 0.07002595800440758, "n_tokens": 41.0}}
{"id": "dev-say-0018", "system": "kotoba-whisper-bilingual-v1.0-q8.greedy", "stage": "asr", "hyp": "まあとりあえずパンダスでCSVを読み込んで、欠損機を確認してみましょう。", "latency_s": 0.7216699999989942, "details": {"logmel_s": 0.002267165924422443, "encoder_s": 0.661504750023596, "decoder_s": 0.057869749958626926, "n_tokens": 32.0}}
{"id": "dev-say-0019", "system": "kotoba-whisper-bilingual-v1.0-q8.greedy", "stage": "asr", "hyp": "A、リアクトのコンポネントが2回レンダリングされる問題はストリクトモードのせいだと思います。", "latency_s": 0.7265249580377713, "details": {"logmel_s": 0.002298666979186237, "encoder_s": 0.6606670420151204, "decoder_s": 0.06353066605515778, "n_tokens": 36.0}}
{"id": "dev-say-0020", "system": "kotoba-whisper-bilingual-v1.0-q8.greedy", "stage": "asr", "hyp": "ポスグレのインデックスを貼ったらクエリが10倍くらい速くなりました", "latency_s": 0.7105870000086725, "details": {"logmel_s": 0.0019115000031888485, "encoder_s": 0.6558967089513317, "decoder_s": 0.05274441605433822, "n_tokens": 27.0}}
